本插件基于 SteamDeckHomebrew 的官方插件模板（decky-plugin-template）开发。
该模板以 BSD 3-Clause 许可发布，其条款要求**保留原始版权声明**，
因此下面同时包含 Steam Deck Homebrew 的原始许可和本项目的许可。

This plugin is based on SteamDeckHomebrew's official plugin template
(decky-plugin-template), which is released under the BSD 3-Clause License.
That license requires the original copyright notice to be retained, so both
the original and this project's license are reproduced below.

